# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth/registry settings from .npmrc — every pnpm-specific
# setting for this repo lives in pnpm-workspace.yaml instead (nodeLinker,
# shamefullyHoist, autoInstallPeers, strictPeerDependencies, frozenLockfile).
# See https://pnpm.io/settings. Left as a comment-only marker so nobody re-adds
# pnpm keys here expecting them to take effect.
